<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 39-week T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 39-week T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of 39-week treasury bills on Wednesday, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last auction of similar T-bills on November 6, the average yield hit 9.669 percent after 9.307 percent on October 30.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
